{"unit_id": "xiaokaizhou__dsh-llm-multimodal#feature-text", "repo": "xiaokaizhou/dsh-llm-multimodal", "commit": "f4d328f7874a84b33abb99c6c0e90dd3b4044a59", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-llm-multimodal** 的功能「文本生成」：在 DSH 对话中调用已配置的语言模型生成文本。工具可指定 `<provider>/<model>`，也能自动选择文本模型，并支持 system prompt。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:1249-1262"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaokaizhou__dsh-llm-multimodal#feature-image", "repo": "xiaokaizhou/dsh-llm-multimodal", "commit": "f4d328f7874a84b33abb99c6c0e90dd3b4044a59", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-llm-multimodal** 的功能「图像生成与编辑」：根据提示生成图像，也可传入一张或多张图片做编辑或组合。工具接收尺寸和数量参数，并返回生成结果及保存位置。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:1381-1408"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaokaizhou__dsh-llm-multimodal#feature-video", "repo": "xiaokaizhou/dsh-llm-multimodal", "commit": "f4d328f7874a84b33abb99c6c0e90dd3b4044a59", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-llm-multimodal** 的功能「视频生成」：按文字描述生成短视频，也支持图片转视频及关键帧模式。调用时可设置时长、画幅、负面提示词和关键帧，生成任务通过 provider 接口提交。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:1587-1605"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaokaizhou__dsh-llm-multimodal#feature-vision", "repo": "xiaokaizhou/dsh-llm-multimodal", "commit": "f4d328f7874a84b33abb99c6c0e90dd3b4044a59", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-llm-multimodal** 的功能「多图视觉问答」：向视觉模型发送问题和一张或多张图片，获取自然语言回答。图片可来自 URL、Data URI 或本地路径，并能附带历史对话及细节级别参数。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:2004-2026"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaokaizhou__dsh-llm-multimodal#feature-audio", "repo": "xiaokaizhou/dsh-llm-multimodal", "commit": "f4d328f7874a84b33abb99c6c0e90dd3b4044a59", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-llm-multimodal** 的功能「语音与音乐生成」：把文字合成为语音，或根据文字提示生成音乐和音效。可指定音色、语速与输出格式；提供参考音频和名称时还能克隆并复用角色音色。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:2257-2281", "lib/index.js:2316-2340"]}
